            "value" : "畫質"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rayon cannot open its database right now, so your servers are not shown. Nothing was changed: they appear once it opens." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rayon 目前无法打开数据库，因此不显示你的服务器。没有任何更改：数据库打开后它们就会出现。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rayon 目前無法開啟資料庫，因此不顯示你的伺服器。沒有任何更改：資料庫開啟後它們就會出現。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rayon has not connected to %@ before. Compare the key's fingerprint with the server's own (ssh-keygen -lf /etc/ssh/ssh_host_*_key.pub) before trusting it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rayon 之前没有连接过 %@。信任之前，请将密钥指纹与服务器自身的指纹（ssh-keygen -lf /etc/ssh/ssh_host_*_key.pub）进行比对。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rayon 之前沒有連線過 %@。信任之前，請將金鑰指紋與伺服器自身的指紋（ssh-keygen -lf /etc/ssh/ssh_host_*_key.pub）進行比對。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rayon may not look on the local network. Allow it in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Local Network." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rayon 无权访问本地网络。请在“系统设置” › “隐私与安全性” › “本地网络”中允许。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rayon 無權訪問本地網路。請在“系統設定” › “隱私與安全性” › “本地網路”中允許。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rayon saved the %@ key of %@; the server now presents its %@ key, which Rayon has not seen. Servers have a key of each type, and this version of Rayon asks for Ed25519 first. Compare the key's fingerprint with the server's own (ssh-keygen -lf /etc/ssh/ssh_host_*_key.pub) before trusting it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rayon saved the %1$@ key of %2$@; the server now presents its %3$@ key, which Rayon has not seen. Servers have a key of each type, and this version of Rayon asks for Ed25519 first. Compare the key's fingerprint with the server's own (ssh-keygen -lf /etc/ssh/ssh_host_*_key.pub) before trusting it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rayon 存储的是 %2$@ 的 %1$@ 密钥；服务器现在出示的是 Rayon 未见过的 %3$@ 密钥。服务器的每种类型各有一个密钥，此版本的 Rayon 会优先请求 Ed25519。信任之前，请将密钥指纹与服务器自身的指纹（ssh-keygen -lf /etc/ssh/ssh_host_*_key.pub）进行比对。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rayon 儲存的是 %2$@ 的 %1$@ 金鑰；伺服器現在出示的是 Rayon 未見過的 %3$@ 金鑰。伺服器的每種型別各有一個金鑰，此版本的 Rayon 會優先請求 Ed25519。信任之前，請將金鑰指紋與伺服器自身的指紋（ssh-keygen -lf /etc/ssh/ssh_host_*_key.pub）進行比對。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rayon signs out of UU Remote; the devices stay on the account." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rayon 将退出 UU 远程登录；设备仍保留在账户中。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rayon 將退出 UU 遠端登入；裝置仍保留在帳號中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
