    "The servers, identities and snippets saved by the previous version of Rayon could not be opened (%@). They are kept as they are, and Rayon tries again on its next launch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法打开旧版 Rayon 存储的服务器、身份和代码片段（%@）。它们会原样保留，Rayon 将在下次启动时重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無法開啟舊版 Rayon 儲存的伺服器、身份和程式碼片段（%@）。它們會原樣保留，Rayon 將在下次啟動時重試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The servers, identities and snippets saved by the previous version of Rayon could not be opened: the key that protects them could not be read from the keychain. They are kept as they are, and Rayon tries again on its next launch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法打开旧版 Rayon 存储的服务器、身份和代码片段：无法从钥匙串读取保护它们的密钥。它们会原样保留，Rayon 将在下次启动时重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無法開啟舊版 Rayon 儲存的伺服器、身份和程式碼片段：無法從鑰匙串讀取保護它們的金鑰。它們會原樣保留，Rayon 將在下次啟動時重試。"
          }
        }
      }
